WEBVTT

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:36.550
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.320
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.100
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.830
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.540
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.120
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.330
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:55.660
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.270
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:01.040
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.730
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.510
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.230
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.840
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.490
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:17.360
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.080
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:22.760
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.370
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:28.140
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.600
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.490
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.490 --> 00:01:35.800
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:36.950
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:45.930
It's a new semester.

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:48.260
I'm finally a sixth-grader.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:51.640
And a fourth Guardian Egg was born.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.020
It's spring.

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:55.390
Which means new beginnings,

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:58.600
and forcing myself to act outside of my character.

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:00.220
And yet...

00:02:02.770 --> 00:02:03.600
Huh?

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.370
My egg...

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:15.680
Has been marked with an "X?"

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:20.680
Failure as the Joker? New Guardians Arrive!

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:20.680
Episode 28

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:24.190
It's getting away!

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.420
Character Change and go after it!

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:31.020
Wait!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:32.310
You dummy!

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.160
How am I supposed to catch up by skipping?

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:34.870
Jeez!

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:36.490
What are you two doing?

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.350
Hop!

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:39.350
Step!

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.350
Jump!

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.740
Wait!

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:45.180
Huh?

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:46.180
What?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.480
Amu-chan!

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.810
She ran into something.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.790
Ouch.

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.370
What did I run into?

00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:59.390
That was a crash landing.

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:00.880
Where's the egg?

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.460
It flew off somewhere.

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:03.960
You're kidding.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.170
Amu-chan, look!

00:03:08.470 --> 00:03:10.950
What? Is this what I ran into?

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.060
Could it be a Guardian Egg?

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:14.850
Look over there!

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.010
Wh-What is this?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:22.640
I mean, who is this?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.970
We brought her home with us for now.

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.670
She's a Guardian Character, right?

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:31.700
Yes.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:34.390
Since she fell down with her egg.

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.560
Her egg. Her egg.

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:41.970
How could my egg be marked with an X?

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:43.220
Amu-chan, calm down!

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.310
My diamond egg!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:49.030
Don't worry!

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:52.060
We can talk about it with the other Guardians tomorrow.

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:53.000
We can't.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.090
There's no way.

00:03:54.090 --> 00:03:56.180
After all, I'm the Joker.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:58.710
My job is to catch X Eggs.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:01.470
But now my own egg has an X.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.890
I'll be demoted!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:07.440
All right, leave her to me.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.340
Miki and Su can help Amu-chan look for the diamond egg tomorrow!

00:04:11.340 --> 00:04:13.050
Understood!

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.270
But Amu-chan...

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:18.270
You need to tell the other Guardians about her.

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.480
Y-Yeah.

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:25.890
Moving along,

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:28.720
we will announce this year's Guardian members.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:34.220
The King's Chair: Hotori Tadase.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:36.720
Tadase-sama!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.720
Hi there!

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.890
The Ace's Chair: Yuiki Yaya.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:42.450
Yaya-chan!

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.180
The Joker: Hinamori Amu.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.620
Amu-chan!

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:48.890
Wh-Wh-What's this?

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.330
Hinamori-senpai is wearing her cape!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.840
This is really rare!

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.300
Camera, camera.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:58.390
Why don't I have a camera on me?

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.020
I suppose I have no choice!

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:02.840
I'll record this with the camera in my heart.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.320
I'm surprised you wore your cape, Amu-chi.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:09.260
Isn't this the first time that's happened?

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:10.730
M-Maybe.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:13.270
I should act like the Joker on these occasions.

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:15.480
To be honest, I'm so embarrassed right now.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.030
But I'm feeling guilty about the X Egg issue.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.450
And here are this year's new members.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.270
The new Jack's Chair: Sanjo Kairi.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.970
The new Queen's Chair: Mashiro Rima.

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:31.420
That girl's a total doll!

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:32.690
So cute.

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:34.560
The new Jack looks cool!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.510
So she really is the new Queen.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.220
Rima! Rima!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.580
Amu! Amu!

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.290
Fealty to the Queen!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:49.220
Wrath of heaven upon the boys!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.770
P-Please quiet down!

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:53.550
Can I go now?

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.520
Um, uh...

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.580
New Guardians.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.380
What's going to happen?

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.600
Let's start by reintroducing ourselves.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.180
Queen's Chair.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.940
Sixth grade. Mashiro Rima.

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:09.970
I'm her Guardian Character, Kusukusu.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.360
Jack's Chair.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.670
Fourth grade. Sanjo Kairi.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:14.750
I am Musashi.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:15.720
Salutations to all.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:19.040
What does "salutations" mean-dechu?

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.390
Don't ask me.

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:21.480
What?

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.750
You don't look anything like a fourth-grader!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.890
Sanjo-kun is pretty tall.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.410
I used to be the youngest!

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:30.320
I'm gonna bully you!

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:31.410
Please go easy on me.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:32.990
Huh? O-Okay.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.310
This boy is the new Jack.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.930
He's like the complete opposite of Kukai.

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:42.310
But I feel like I've seen him somewhere before.

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.470
I am the leader, Kiseki.

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.640
My dream is world domination.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.960
Who made you the leader-dechu?

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.670
I'm Su!

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:53.600
Nice to meet you!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:54.810
She's Miki.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.980
And there's also Ran, even though she's not here right now.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:58.640
Hi!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.170
We're all Amu-chan's Guardian Characters.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:04.500
Ah, I am profoundly grateful for the considerate explanation.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:06.770
So...

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:09.780
Do you have anything to say as the new Queen, Mashiro-san?

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.380
Can I leave now?

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:13.230
We just got here!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.080
Tea.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.770
Yes, Rima-tan!

00:07:16.770 --> 00:07:18.520
You even have a servant here, huh?

00:07:19.810 --> 00:07:23.400
Then I'll start by explaining the Guardians' activities.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.470
That won't be necessary.

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:28.410
I have already prepared accordingly.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:31.470
I perused the activity reports from the past five years.

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:34.430
However, there was too much waste.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:38.930
In order for a small organization to supervise the entire student body, you must consolidate.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:42.720
In other words, we need to act in an efficient and effective manner.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:47.740
If you look at the data, the few elite union leaders started by-

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:47.800
Shut up!

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:50.080
You're too uppity for someone younger!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.310
Your character's too different from Kukai's!

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:54.350
I never mentioned the Kobo Daishi?

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.200
What's the Kobo Daishi?

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.240
The Kobo Daishi, whose name was Kukai, was the founder of the Japanese Shingon Buddhism.

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:02.450
His given name was Saeki Mao.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.390
So it isn't just the Queen.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.300
Even the Jack has an oddball character.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.030
Amu-chan, it's about time.

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:05.520
Yeah.

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:09.520
I have to tell them about the diamond egg.

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.160
E-Excuse me.

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.850
And the biggest problem

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.470
would be the Joker.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:15.350
Huh?

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.740
According to my independent investigation,

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.620
there has been a sudden spike

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.600
in the number of minors with "empty hearts" these past few months.

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:24.200
The cause is unknown.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.190
But there is one thing we can be certain of.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.180
Which would be...

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:30.850
You aren't hunting X Eggs fast enough.

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.000
Which means that you are a failure as the Joker.

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.410
Failure.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:36.860
Failure?

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:39.050
Failure.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.640
A-Amu-chan, come back to us!

00:08:39.860 --> 00:08:41.640
H-Her soul!

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:43.270
I hate Japanese tea.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.380
I want cocoa.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.890
And I don't like rice crackers either.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.450
Sorry.

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:50.500
I only know how to make Japanese tea.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:51.800
Failure.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.540
Yaya.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:53.790
Buy me cocoa.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:55.390
Roger, Rima-tan!

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:59.650
The new Guardians have created a strained atmosphere.

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.180
I'll note that in the data.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.180
Still...

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.150
Sanjo-kun does have a point.

00:09:05.150 --> 00:09:06.430
He recovered!

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.790
We don't know why the number of X Eggs is increasing,

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:11.060
but we can't ignore that fact.

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:12.170
Okay.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.670
We'll take turns supporting the Joker.

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:17.430
From now on, we'll hunt X Eggs in teams.

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:18.620
Huh?

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.600
First, in part to also train our newcomers,

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:23.310
could you pair up with Mashiro-san?

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:23.980
What?

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.580
Th-There's no way!

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.020
Understood.

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.600
Why did she suddenly become so obedient?

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.090
An appropriate proposition.

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:31.890
Huh?

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.810
What do you think, Hinamori-san?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.620
I'll give it my best.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:39.770
Let's work our hardest.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.640
I'm sure you can do it, Hinamori-san.

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.270
I have faith in you.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.890
Wh-Why are you...

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.090
Because you are the person I like.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.360
Amulet Heart.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:58.430
Amulet Heart.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:02.360
Cheerful, positive, and strong...

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:04.770
It was the first time I'd ever seen a girl like that.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:06.990
A girl like Amulet Heart!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.220
Y-You've got it wrong!

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.060
That's just a Character Transformation.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:11.240
It's not me!

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.870
You should know that, Tadase-kun!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.450
That may be true,

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.670
but Amulet Heart is still you.

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.390
You're the only one who can become her.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.030
Thanks.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:26.810
I'll do my best!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:28.180
Great.

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.750
I have returned!

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.370
Rima-tan, your cocoa!

00:10:34.380 --> 00:10:36.450
That's not the brand I like.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:37.930
Shocking!

00:10:36.930 --> 00:10:39.180
Mashiro-san, let's go!

00:10:39.180 --> 00:10:41.190
We're off!

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:42.850
Do your best, girls!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.410
I see.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.240
An unusual relationship exists between the King and Joker.

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.770
I'll also put that in the data.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.230
Tadase-kun has faith in me.

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:56.720
I'll try having faith in myself.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.930
A Joker and Queen pair.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:06.060
Good luck, our Joker.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.050
We're off!

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:19.810
Excuse us, King.

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.930
Yep, good work.

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:33.100
So the Queen and Jack will guide the Joker, huh?

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.270
What's wrong, Tadase?

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:40.770
I was wondering what he meant when he said that.

00:11:40.770 --> 00:11:43.290
Only the key can open the lock.

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.560
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:49.910
Why are you here?

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.260
It's been a while, Tadase.

00:11:52.260 --> 00:11:53.560
Don't act so friendly with me!

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.420
You're being pretty familiar yourself.

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:57.320
Yeah.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.890
Pretty arbitrary, Tadase.

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:01.010
Be quiet!

00:12:01.010 --> 00:12:01.810
Come down here!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.220
There you go.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:12.600
You've grown taller.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:13.670
Silence.

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:16.270
You're just after the Humpty Lock.

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:18.670
That's why you're getting close to Hinamori-san.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:19.520
Am I wrong?

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:22.750
You plan to steal it, don't you?

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:25.470
The way you stole the Dumpty Key from me.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:28.170
I don't appreciate you saying that I stole it.

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.220
I simply took back what belonged to me.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:31.970
Be quiet!

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.040
That's why you approached us in the first place.

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:37.850
I will never forgive you.

00:12:39.970 --> 00:12:41.220
Ikuto!

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.110
Man.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.380
You're not so cute anymore.

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:50.460
When you were little, you would chase after me crying, "Big Brother! Big Brother!"

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:51.420
S-Shut up!

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:51.970
Silence!

00:12:51.970 --> 00:12:55.510
It's dirty to bring up stuff from the past!

00:12:55.510 --> 00:12:56.810
Calm down, Tadase.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.530
But it's true.

00:12:58.530 --> 00:12:59.810
S-Silence!

00:12:59.810 --> 00:13:05.310
You were so happy when you learned how to ride a bike, thanks to your "big brother."

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:06.190
Silence!

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:07.460
Silence! Silence!

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.850
Tadase!

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.780
I don't actually know what I'm going to do about Amu.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.650
My mood changes with my tail.

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.560
With his tail!

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.150
What brought them here?

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:26.890
Hinamori-san.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:31.180
Okay, time to do my best!

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:34.410
Which means, I'll catch every X Egg in town!

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.560
And then my diamond egg will also

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.540
definitely be found!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:40.850
Found!

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.980
Hey, you.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.450
It's time for you to wake up.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:50.840
Amu-chan's not here and I'm bored! Bored!

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.470
Wakey, wakey!

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:54.580
Jeez, in that case...

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:56.420
The wakey dance!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.040
Wakey, wakey! Wakey, wakey!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:02.520
Wakey, wakey! Wake up already!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.520
Be quiet.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:03.700
Where am I?

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:05.330
You woke up!

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.640
Though your eyes are still closed.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.220
What?!

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.900
I have been taken captive.

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:16.170
A horrible mistake.

00:14:16.170 --> 00:14:16.770
Huh?

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:18.410
I'll be assaulted!

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:20.120
Ravaged!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.440
Wai-

00:14:20.120 --> 00:14:21.040
Ravaged!

00:14:24.720 --> 00:14:26.600
Um, uh...

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:27.840
You okay?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.850
Amu?

00:14:28.850 --> 00:14:31.240
Did you just mention Amu-chan?

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:32.370
Ah, yeah.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.210
She's our owner.

00:14:34.210 --> 00:14:36.170
I'm glad you're okay.

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:37.790
By the way, I'm Ran.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:41.470
H-H-Hinamori Amu.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:39.270
I'm good at cheerleading.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.470
My favorite color is pink.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:45.580
W-Wait!

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:46.480
Hey!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.090
What's wrong?

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:49.100
Hello?

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:53.550
To think that I've come to the home of Utau-chan's arch-nemesis.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:55.600
What should I do,

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.680
Utau-chan?

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:00.640
Hey, look at that!

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.470
Could that be...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:19.100
Open your shiny eyes in the silent night.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.750
An unannounced concert?

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.640
Swooping down on this mysterious eve,

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.640
Wicked.

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:26.220
sneaking up close without making a footstep,

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:34.620
the black cat makes a seductive pose.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.890
Go for it, Utau!

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:36.940
Hello?

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:40.330
Why are you cooped up in there, El?

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.120
Please don't be so friendly with me.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:45.350
Hinamori Amu is Utau-chan's arch-nemesis.

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:47.850
Which means we, as their Guardian Characters, are also enemies.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:49.840
Really?

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:50.720
Yes!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:52.630
Please shut up now.

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:55.650
You probably want to know whose Guardian Character I am.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.840
Too bad for you!

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:58.850
My lips are sealed!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.890
Hoshina Utau?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:02.920
How did you know?

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:04.120
Because you just-

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:05.420
It's psychometry!

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.770
She read my mind!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:11.100
My heart was about to be stolen!

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:11.750
Thief!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:13.660
You heart thief!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.700
Please wait a moment

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.850
Dechu...

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:19.970
That Il is so mean.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:21.990
She's always bullying me.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.240
So you ran away.

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:25.650
That's right.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:27.120
She's all buddy-buddy now.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:29.320
The same goes for Utau-chan.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:31.880
She keeps teaming up with Il to do bad things.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:32.970
Bad things?

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:36.270
They don't care about me anymore.

00:16:38.740 --> 00:16:41.870
What did you mean when you said they're doing bad things?

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.310
That would be...

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:50.970
I sing of freedom on invisible wings;

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:57.970
I've hidden them deep inside your heart.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.930
Here they come! Here they come!

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:04.920
Keep going, Utau!

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:08.180
Great haul!

00:17:08.180 --> 00:17:10.410
You've really picked up the pace.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:11.280
Utau,

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.640
you sure get the job done when you try.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:17.110
It feels great to have that annoying El gone.

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:18.740
I can do whatever I want!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.100
We can take all the hearts' eggs we want!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:24.850
People with empty hearts'll pop out in mass numbers!

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:29.560
Sanjo-san, why are you collecting X Eggs?

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:33.040
I thought any eggs that weren't the Embryo were worthless junk?

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:34.140
Are you curious?

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:37.600
It's a recycling plan for worthless eggs.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:40.270
Yuu's methods served as a hint.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:44.390
Of course, I don't plan on imitating his failure.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:45.910
Nikaidou-san?

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.920
Didn't you used to date him?

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.030
Stop that!

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.660
It was a dark period in my life!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.640
I just need to find the Embryo.

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:57.260
Hold on, Ikuto.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.020
I'll be the one who gets the Embryo.

00:18:00.020 --> 00:18:02.170
Not Amu.

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.890
Me.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.520
X Eggs. X Eggs.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.910
Amu-chan, wait!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:11.440
Behind you.

00:18:14.930 --> 00:18:17.000
Sorry, was I running too fast?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:17.970
Not really.

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.210
This is normal.

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:20.360
You're panting.

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:22.100
How so?

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:26.220
Well, it's not surprising, since you're as small as a first-grader.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:27.350
Ah, hey!

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:30.090
Why don't you get a servant to carry you?

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:32.140
Oh, good idea.

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.740
Carry me.

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:35.620
You mean me?

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:39.250
Hey!

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:41.100
You're gonna look for another servant?

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:42.680
You sure recovered fast!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:43.900
You can't do that!

00:18:43.900 --> 00:18:44.510
Confiscated!

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.920
You can't keep on depending on other people!

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:52.710
Oh no!

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.930
I'm just kidding! Kidding! Sorry!

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:54.930
Simpleton.

00:18:54.930 --> 00:18:57.150
You can't even tell that I'm pretending to cry?

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:01.500
I believe that a girl should be able to cry at will.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.720
Why you!

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.220
Incredible.

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.090
Look at that girl!

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:08.170
So adorable!

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.640
Like an angel!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:11.770
She's only adorable on the outside.

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:16.100
Isn't your Guardian Character named Kusukusu?

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.410
You can Character Change and stuff, right?

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.100
How does yours work?

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:21.850
It's like...

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.810
It doesn't matter.

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.320
What's with the attitude?

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:26.640
So not cute.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:29.540
I don't care about using Character Change.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.370
I have something more...

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:34.890
Look. There's one.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:38.890
An X Egg?

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:41.080
It's not mine.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:43.350
Kusukusu, Character Transformation.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:46.600
My heart: Unlock.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:04.310
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:05.780
They Character Transformed!

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.350
Clown Drop.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.410
I'll show you.

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:11.740
What are you going to do?

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:12.970
That should be obvious.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.970
Juggling Party!

00:20:38.690 --> 00:20:41.390
You couldn't even move. How stupid.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:44.600
Why don't you quit being the Joker?

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:54.380
Why don't you quit being the Joker?

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:01.770
Cheese!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.220
Ami-chan, say "cheese" for me again!

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:07.490
Ah, welcome home, Amu-chan.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.600
Welcome home, Sis!

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:11.100
Huh?

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:13.640
Wow, "cool & spicy!"

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.600
What a horrible day.

00:21:21.070 --> 00:21:23.850
And I have no idea where Dia went.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:24.890
Amu-chan.

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:26.670
What?

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:29.430
Utau-chan is emptying everybody's hearts?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:31.290
Is that true, El?

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:32.540
It's true.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:34.810
X Eggs are being mass produced!

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:36.810
X Eggs, you said?

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.890
Somebody must stop Utau-chan before

00:21:41.620 --> 00:21:44.680
things get out of hand!

00:21:57.680 --> 00:21:58.850
Sanjo-san.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:00.300
You dropped one.

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:02.740
Could you put it back in the box for me?

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:08.640
What's with this X Egg?

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:12.240
{daiyamo shugo-tama?}A diamond Guardian Egg?

00:22:13.840 --> 00:22:15.920
Utau is collecting X Eggs?

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.040
What's going on here?

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:49.230
I'm number one today, of course!

00:23:50.020 --> 00:23:51.640
Hello, I'm El.

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:52.890
Who's this out of the blue?

00:23:52.890 --> 00:23:55.380
She ran away from Utau-chan.

00:23:55.380 --> 00:23:56.590
Nice to meet you.

00:23:56.590 --> 00:23:58.350
Let's be good fr-

00:23:57.430 --> 00:23:59.780
Shut up, arch-nemesis!

00:23:59.780 --> 00:24:00.540
What?

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:02.980
Since Amu-chan is just bumbling around all worried,

00:24:02.980 --> 00:24:04.920
starting next week, El will be the main character.

00:24:04.920 --> 00:24:06.880
In other words, I'll be the heroine!

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:07.600
Hold it right there!

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:09.620
No one told me about that!

00:24:09.620 --> 00:24:10.990
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:13.060
Character Transformation!? Amulet Angel!

00:24:13.060 --> 00:24:14.310
She's seriously taking over?

00:24:14.310 --> 00:24:17.290
And what's Amulet Angel supposed to be?

00:24:17.290 --> 00:24:20.060
Hey, listen to me!
